<https://id.i2idl.org/definitions/instructional-effectiveness> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "ERIC scope note: Degree to which instructional materials or programs are successful in accomplishing their objectives" <https://id.i2idl.org/graphs/concepts/instructional-effectiveness/versions/1> .
<https://id.i2idl.org/definitions/instructional-effectiveness> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://glossarystudio.app/ns/Definition> <https://id.i2idl.org/graphs/concepts/instructional-effectiveness/versions/1> .
<https://id.i2idl.org/definitions/instructional-effectiveness> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value> "The degree to which instruction, materials, or educational programs support the achievement of their intended learning objectives." <https://id.i2idl.org/graphs/concepts/instructional-effectiveness/versions/1> .
